{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">仿佛刚刚抵达一个无比明亮的顶点，心却并没有真正落地。低处有一股稳稳托住的力量，上方的声音仍层层翻涌，灿烂得近乎刺痛。越是纷乱，越能感到里面有个不肯松开的支点。细密的闪光又把情绪推高了一次，像已经忍住的泪意忽然重新涌到眼眶。可紧接着，巨浪似乎一下子退远了，只剩轻柔的摇晃。清冷的音粒从高处缓缓滑下，透明得像水滴落进水面，一圈圈微颤。外面渐渐安静，胸口却还留着刚才的热度。那种浓烈并没有真的消散，只是从汹涌变成了隐隐的震颤，明明已经轻了下来，心里却仍然紧紧揪着，久久不能平复。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-0566507af42042d2a1d0f522e06cb385", "response_sha256": "4f99a0f86ccfe8dce52125de5b254d57fd25cbe844bb1f0f1c5b107b138b93b6", "session_handle": "abb17363-1f84-4390-9e9c-b888d1027cc9", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 1.043, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.95}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 67, "first_assistant_seconds": 24.516, "first_text_seconds": 30.266, "stream_seconds": 37.469, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 58}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observatio